## Model card

- **Name:** Gemini 3.7 Flash
- **Short description:** Google/DeepMind’s Gemini 3.7 Flash is a previous-generation Flash model in the Gemini 3 series, positioned as a fast workhorse for coding and agentic tasks with multimodal inputs and a 1M-token context window. Google AI developer docs indicate it has been deprecated/routed to Gemini 3.8 Flash.
- **Provider / access:** Google AI Studio / Gemini API and Gemini app surfaces (per DeepMind/Google AI docs). Local metadata lists `google/gemini-3.7-flash` and notes free tier availability on Google AI Studio with standard rate limits.
- **Release / knowledge:** Google AI developer docs list latest update as August 2026 for `gemini-3.7-flash`; detailed release/knowledge cutoff not clearly extracted in this pass.
- **IDs:** `gemini-3.7-flash`.
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 input tokens; 65,536 output tokens (Google AI developer docs). Local metadata states 1,048,576 (1M).
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video, audio, and PDF input; text output (Google AI developer docs).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Local metadata notes free tier and intro paid pricing context; specific current API pricing for this deprecated model was not clearly extracted from reviewed pages in this pass.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary Google/DeepMind model; architecture/parameter count not publicly disclosed.

